WEBVTT

00:17:56.530 --> 00:18:01.663
particularly driven
by venture capital investment,

00:18:01.697 --> 00:18:04.463
by the quest to be able
to create a product

00:18:04.497 --> 00:18:08.730
that then can help create wealth

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:13.030
and actually provide
a benefit to humankind

00:18:13.063 --> 00:18:15.897
drives a lot of things
that we've done all through history.

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:18.097
And I don't think
it'll be any different now.

00:18:18.597 --> 00:18:21.097
I think the question is,

00:18:21.097 --> 00:18:23.030
can we pull together enough nations

00:18:23.063 --> 00:18:29.363
to leverage a uniform approach
to the judgment

00:18:29.397 --> 00:18:31.897
about the kinds of investments
that are being made.